      "boundaryDescription": "Four Lower Super Output Areas: Bidston & St James West (LSOA E01007123 / Wirral 011D), Birkenhead West (LSOA E01007127 / Wirral 016B), Egremont North (LSOA E01007218 / Wirral 002A) and Seacombe St Paul's (LSOA E01007273 / Wirral 008B). Scheme 4a additionally covers all properties in Paterson Street and the even numbers of Park Close, both in Birkenhead, from 1 July 2024. The council states that any private rented property located within the LSOA boundary at the time of designation or over the lifetime of the scheme is liable for a licence, so the address list is guidance rather than an exhaustive definition.",
